{"id":"657786","name":"钵仔肉","author":"_蒍鉨变乖々","authorId":"8010238","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/657786/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"五花肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜头","amount":"适量"},{"name":"小米辣","amount":"适量"},{"name":"豆豉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"八角","amount":"适量"},{"name":"桂皮","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香叶","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"焯过水的五花肉放入珐琅锅中。","img":"images/657786/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入八角，桂皮，香叶。","img":"images/657786/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"加入适量生抽，老抽，盐。","img":"images/657786/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"加入适量清水。","img":"images/657786/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"盖上大火煮开转小火煲40分钟左右。","img":"images/657786/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"蒜头和小米辣切碎。","img":"images/657786/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"碗中放入切碎的小米辣和蒜头，再来一点豆豉。","img":"images/657786/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"淋上热油激发出香味。","img":"images/657786/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/657786/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"卤煮好的肉切薄片。","img":"images/657786/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将肉片摆放在碗里。","img":"images/657786/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"铺上豆豉蒜头小米辣。","img":"images/657786/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"锅中加入足够的水，将五花肉上锅蒸。","img":"images/657786/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"大火煮开转小火蒸30分钟左右。","img":"images/657786/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657786/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/657786/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}